? box BACK -> 10,19.229950319375444 1.7193044712562102,19.229950319375444 1.7193044712562102,23.28956706884315 10,23.28956706884315
? bbox BACK -> 1.7193044712562102,19.229950319375444 10,23.28956706884315
? snaps BACK -> Insertion 10,20

